==== hyperbricks yaml {!{images}} ====
images:
  - type: images
  - attributes:
      decoding: async
  - directory: hyperbricks-yaml-test-files/assets/
  - id: '#galleryimage_'
  - loading: lazy
  - width: "100"
==== explainer ====
Extra attributes like id, data-role, data-action
